! mcp_bootstrap_p197.strap -- MCP printed page 197: the tail of UNLOAD
! (K CUSTM .. K 2 MUCH) and its messages, to the end of the program text.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_001-249.pdf PDF p.204, read at 400 dpi.  Header, READ:
! "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP  CARD ID LH000043  DIST. OF 3/01
!  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 197"; the heading row's LOCATION field is 221766,
! line 1's word (docs/transcription_workflow.md step 1).
!
! FIRST PAGE LANDED WITH THE VISION READING AS ITS FINDING AID
! (tools/page_sheet.py 197): 26 lines, LOCATION agreed or confirmed on
! 25, BINARY h1 trusted on 12, six statements confirmed by assembly
! before a glyph was read.  Every value below is read off the IMAGE; the
! sheet only said where to look hardest.
!
! THE PAGE.  Contiguous from 221766.40 to 222017.40, then blank paper.
!   lines  1-17  code: K CUSTM, K KUSTM (the next vacant reel), K K TAPE,
!                K R ONLY, K 2 MUCH (the S 2 BIG request), to S DISP.
!   lines 18-25  CNOP and five (IQSX)DD messages; lines 22-23 compile
!                one word and a CNOP that emits nothing.
!   line  26     K UL MES VF,K UNL M+.192, printed 222004.00+.
! p.196 ends at 221766.00 (a half word), so line 1's .40 continues it.
!
! >>> "C" FOR "D", THREE TIMES. <<<  The page prints B,KFUNLC.32 and
! B,K UNLC1 / B,K UNLC1+1.32.  K F UNLD and K UNLD1 are p.196's lines
! 15 and 27; no KFUNLC or KUNLC1 is defined anywhere, and the binaries
! (221742.10 = 221741.40 + .32 + B's 8; 221751.10, 221752.50) are
! THOSE addresses.  This drum prints D with its stem worn through
! (transcription_workflow.md "C vs D"), so the deck spells them D.
!
! >>> THE CARD SERIALS. <<<  p.196 ends at LH000041 and this page
! opens at LH000043: no LH000042 is printed on either page.  And lines
! 16 (SIC,S DISIC) and 17 (B,S DISP .) BOTH print LH000058.  Recorded,
! not explained.  Line 17's statement prints a lone "." after S DISP.
!
! >>> LINE 11'S LAST BYTE PRINTS "AC" AND IS A0. <<<  Read at 900 dpi:
! the glyph after A is the same open round that this row prints in
! its OCTAL fields, where only a 0 can stand (222013.CC, 222006.C4).
! The statement cannot make a C there: TI's low nibble is I2 (bits
! 60-63, strap_asm enc_transmit), and no second-operand index is
! printed; and p.196 line 20 prints this SAME second half word,
! "222006.04 A0".  Vision read AC too -- the C/0 confusion.
!
! The data cards' blanks are DATA (entry mode): each count is the one
! the next card's LOCATION requires, and it matches the gap on the ink.

SOWNER  SYN(BU,1), 0.32              ! landed; p.99 -PRIORITY LEVEL
SMARK   SYN, (8)215012.40            ! landed; p.99 -THE NEXT VACANT REEL
SMAXUB  SYN, (8)215225.0             ! KV on line 5, half word only
KFUNLD  SYN, (8)221741.40            ! p.196 line 15 "K F UNLD"
KUNLD1  SYN, (8)221751.0             ! p.196 line 27 "K UNLD1"
S2BIG   SYN, (8)010006.0             ! LVI on line 15: 0o35 = 2J+1, J=14
SDISIC  SYN, (8)217451.40            ! landed; SIC, BIT-EXACT
SDISP   SYN, (8)217372.0             ! landed; B, half word only

        SLC, (8)221766.40
KCUSTM  BZB,SOWNER($11),KKUSTM                               ! line  1
        SV,$9,0.0($9)                                        ! line  2  -CIRCLE MCP TABLE
        B,KFUNLD.32                                          ! line  3
KKUSTM  LV,8,SMARK                                           ! line  4
        KV,8,SMAXUB                                          ! line  5  -CHECK FOR BOUNDARY CROSS OVER
        BZXL,K2MUCH                                          ! line  6
        SV,8,0.0($9)                                         ! line  7  -PLACE IT IN NEXT RL SLCT
        M+1(BU,18),SMARK                                     ! line  8
        Z,0.0($8)                                            ! line  9
        CM1111(BU,1),.27($8)                                 ! line 10
KKTAPE  TI,2,KSCRAC,KREELN                                   ! line 11
        B,KUNLD1                                             ! line 12
KRONLY  LVI,7,9.                                             ! line 13
        B,KUNLD1+1.32                                        ! line 14
K2MUCH  LVI,14,S2BIG                                         ! line 15
        SIC,SDISIC                                           ! line 16
        B,SDISP                                              ! line 17
        CNOP                                                 ! line 18
KUNLM   (IQSX)DD(BU,64),REPLACE TAPE ON CHANNEL 32 UNIT 8 WITH  X ! line 19
KREELN  (IQSX)DD(BU),REEL NO. 12345      JOB X               ! line 20
ZUNLO2  (IQSX)DD(BU),        X                               ! line 21
        (IQSX)DD(BU), PROTECTX                               ! line 22
        CNOP                                                 ! line 23
KSCRAC  (IQSX)DD(BU,64),A SCRATCH TAPE  X                    ! line 24
KEXTAP  (IQSX)DD(BU,64),REEL NO.            X                ! line 25
KULMES  VF,KUNLM+.192                                        ! line 26

!SYM KCUSTM 221766.40
!SYM KKUSTM 221770.40
!SYM KKTAPE 221775.00
!SYM KRONLY 221776.40
!SYM K2MUCH 221777.40
!SYM KUNLM  222001.00
!SYM KREELN 222006.00
!SYM ZUNLO2 222011.00
!SYM KSCRAC 222013.00
!SYM KEXTAP 222015.00
!SYM KULMES 222017.40
!CHECK 221766.40 | 000000.40 8B 221770.74 00 | line 1 K CUSTM BZB,S OWNER($11),K KUSTM
!CHECK 221767.40 | 000000.23 39 | line 2 SV,$9,0.0($9)
!CHECK 221770.00 | 221742.10 00 | line 3 B,KFUNLC.32 as printed (D worn to C)
!CHECK 221770.40 | 215012.60 30 | line 4 K KUSTM LV,8,S MARK (hex prints 3C; an octal-field gauge row)
!CHECK 221771.00 | 215225.20 90 | line 5 KV,8,S MAXUB
!CHECK 221771.40 | 221777.72 40 | line 6 BZXL,K 2 MUCH
!CHECK 221772.00 | 000000.21 39 | line 7 SV,8,0.0($9)
!CHECK 221772.40 | 215012.40 80 022000.22 B0 | line 8 M+1(BU,18),S MARK
!CHECK 221773.40 | 000000.22 08 | line 9 Z,0.0($8)
!CHECK 221774.00 | 000000.33 88 001000.36 F0 | line 10 CM1111(BU,1),.27($8)
!CHECK 221775.00 | 222013.00 80 222006.04 A0 | line 11 K K TAPE TI,2,K SCRAC,K REEL N (a "*" prints after the location; byte prints "AC" -- see header)
!CHECK 221776.00 | 221751.10 00 | line 12 B,K UNLC1 as printed (D worn to C)
!CHECK 221776.40 | 000011.17 01 | line 13 K R ONLY LVI,7,9.
!CHECK 221777.00 | 221752.50 00 | line 14 B,K UNLC1+1.32 as printed
!CHECK 221777.40 | 010006.35 01 | line 15 K 2 MUCH LVI,14,S 2 BIG
!CHECK 222000.00 | 217451.40 80 | line 16 SIC,S DISIC
!CHECK 222000.40 | 217372.10 00 | line 17 B,S DISP .
!CHECK 222017.40 | 222004.00+ | line 26 K UL MES VF,K UNL M+.192
